  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Portfolio Structure**\n\nI\'m solidifying the project\'s foundation. The goal: a standout portfolio website for Vivek Dalvi, crafted in AI Studio. It will leverage React and Tailwind CSS. The resume data and \"Portfolio Architect Prompt\" are guiding me in structuring content and layout.\n\n\n**Refining My Focus**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on Vivek\'s brand identity, distinguishing him as an AI specialist, engineer, and creative technologist. The structure will feature a hero section highlighting his AI & ML student status and full-stack capabilities, followed by an \"About Me\" section. I\'m shaping a \"Technical Bento Box\" showcasing skills and projects.\n\n\n"
