  planner_response {
    response: "I have successfully built your professional portfolio, synthesizing your diverse experience from **Prompt Engineering** to **Full-Stack AI** into a cohesive, high-end professional brand.\n\n### **Portfolio Highlights:**\n*   **Brand Identity:** Blended your roles as an **AI Specialist** (Agentic AI, RAG), **Engineer** (PII detection, production-grade systems), and **Creative Technologist** (EduDiff animations).\n*   **Design Aesthetic:** Implemented a **Cyber-minimalism** dark mode using a custom color palette (`cyber-accent` neon green) and modern typography (**Inter** and **JetBrains Mono**).\n*   **Technical Bento Box:** Categorized your skills into Languages, AI/LLM Stack, and Dev Tools for quick scannability.\n*   **Deep Dive Projects:** Detailed sections for **CampusPal** (hallucination defense), **EduDiff** (Manim + Gemini 2.5 Flash), and **TransactAI** (DistilBERT).\n*   **Interactive Elements:** Used `motion` for smooth scroll animations and hover effects on project cards and skill badges.\n\n### **Technical Implementation:**\n*   **React & Tailwind CSS:** Built as a responsive one-page layout.\n*   **Lucide Icons:** Integrated for a clean, professional look.\n*   **Structured Data:** Used a separate `constants.ts` file for easy content management and updates.\n\nYou can now view your portfolio in the preview window. If you\'d like to refine the **Hero Statement** or add more specific details to the **About Me** section, just let me know!"
