  user_input {
    user_response: "Vivek Dalvi - Projects Portfolio Report\nOverview\nBased on your GitHub repositories, here\'s a detailed report of the 6 major projects you\'ve built, showcasing diverse AI/ML, full-stack, and mobile development expertise.\n\n1. \360\237\216\223 CampusPal - AI Campus Assistant\nRepository: https://github.com/Vivek5143/CampusPal\n\n\360\237\223\235 Description\nAn AI-powered campus assistant specifically designed for APSIT (Ajay Patel Institute of Software Technology). It provides intelligent responses to student queries about admissions, fees, courses, placements, faculty, and campus facilities.\n\n\360\237\217\227\357\270\217 Architecture\nFrontend: React 19 + Vite + Tailwind CSS (Floating chat widget)\nBackend: FastAPI + Python\nAI/RAG: LangChain + ChatGroq + FAISS Vector Database\nEmbeddings: Hugging Face sentence-transformers\nDeployment: Docker, Render (backend), Vercel (frontend)\n\342\234\250 Key Features\nRetrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) with FAISS vectors\nChat history persistence with browser local storage\nLight/Dark mode support\nMarkdown-rendered responses with source attribution\nCurated document filtering for high-signal APSIT information\nFull Docker compose setup\n\360\237\233\240\357\270\217 Tech Stack\nReact 19, Vite, Tailwind CSS, FastAPI, LangChain, Groq LLM, FAISS, Hugging Face Embeddings, Docker\n\n2. \360\237\216\254 EduDiff - AI-Powered Math Animation Generator\nRepository: https://github.com/Vivek5143/EduDiff\n\n\360\237\223\235 Description\nA full-stack application that converts text prompts into animated mathematical explanations using Manim, Flask, and Google Gemini. Creates beautiful, publication-quality math visualizations from simple descriptions.\n\n\360\237\217\227\357\270\217 Architecture\nFrontend: Next.js 3000\nBackend: Flask + Manim 5001\nLLM: Google Gemini (via google-genai SDK)\nVideo Generation: Manim (Mathematical Animation Engine)\nDeployment: Docker Compose\n\342\234\250 Key Features\nGenerate Manim videos from text prompts (concepts + equations)\nComplete Docker setup for development and deployment\nVideo serving from backend static routes\nSupport for complex mathematical animations\n3D visualization capabilities\nMultiple render quality options\n\360\237\233\240\357\270\217 Tech Stack\nNext.js, Flask, Manim, Google Gemini API, Docker, Python, JavaScript\n\n3. \360\237\222\263 TransactAI - Hybrid Transaction Categorizer\nRepository: https://github.com/Vivek5143/TransactAI\n\n\360\237\223\235 Description\nA production-focused transaction classification service that blends deterministic banking heuristics with a fine-tuned DistilBERT sequence classifier plus a SentenceTransformer embedding fallback. Automatically categorizes financial transactions from SMS/UPI messages.\n\n\360\237\217\227\357\270\217 Architecture\nMulti-Component Stack:\n\nBackend: FastAPI service with DistilBERT classifier\nFrontend: Next.js 14 dashboard with TypeScript\nMobile: Android app (Kotlin) with NotificationListenerService\nDatabase: PostgreSQL + SQLAlchemy\nAI/ML: PyTorch, Transformers, DistilBERT, SentenceTransformers\n\342\234\250 Key Features\nHybrid 3-tier categorization: Rules \342\206\222 DistilBERT \342\206\222 Embeddings\nDomain-aware preprocessing: Indian banking language optimization\nFine-tuned DistilBERT: 40% smaller than BERT with comparable accuracy\nAndroid mobile app: Automatic UPI/banking notification detection\nReal-time dashboard: Category charts, trends, filtering\nFP16 inference, batch processing, ONNX export support\n\360\237\223\212 Supported Categories\nFood, Shopping, Entertainment, Travel, Utilities, Medical, Education, Insurance, Investments, etc.\n\n\360\237\233\240\357\270\217 Tech Stack\nFastAPI, PostgreSQL, PyTorch, Transformers, DistilBERT, SentenceTransformers, Next.js 14, TypeScript, TailwindCSS, ShadcnUI, Android (Kotlin), Docker Compose\n\n4. \360\237\222\254 InstaClaim - Insurance Claim Support Chatbot\nRepository: https://github.com/Vivek5143/InstaClaim\n\n\360\237\223\235 Description\nA smart, AI-powered insurance claim assistant chatbot designed to help users understand, analyze, and process insurance claim queries and documents. Combines OCR, NLP, and local LLM technology.\n\n\360\237\217\227\357\270\217 Architecture\nFrontend: Streamlit UI (Black & Gold theme)\nBackend: Python with LangChain\nLLM: Ollama\'s Phi3:mini model (fully offline)\nOCR: Tesseract\nImage Processing: PIL + pytesseract\n\342\234\250 Key Features\nImage upload support: JPG/PNG insurance documents\nOCR text extraction: Tesseract-powered document scanning\nContext-aware AI responses: Injected document context into chat\nFully offline: No external API keys needed\nInsurance-specific guidance: Domain-tailored responses\nConversational interface: Streamlit chat experience\n\360\237\233\240\357\270\217 Tech Stack\nStreamlit, LangChain, Ollama (Phi3:mini), Tesseract OCR, Python, PIL, pytesseract\n\n5. \360\237\244\226 Multi-Agent Platform - CrewAI Projects\nRepository: https://github.com/Vivek5143/Multi-Agent-Platform\n\n\360\237\223\235 Description\nA collection of four AI-powered multi-agent applications built using CrewAI, where specialized agents collaborate sequentially to solve real-world tasks. Demonstrates advanced agentic AI workflows.\n\n\360\237\216\256 Project 1: Game Development Crew\nAgents: Creative Designer \342\206\222 Python Developer \342\206\222 QA Engineer\nOutput: Complete 2D Pygame game from text idea\nGenerates: Game Design Document + Source Code + Review\n\360\237\223\235 Project 2: Blog Writing Crew\nAgents: Content Strategist \342\206\222 Blog Writer \342\206\222 Editor\nOutput: SEO-friendly publish-ready blog posts\nFeatures: Markdown generation + Proofreading\n\360\237\220\236 Project 3: Code Debugger Crew\nAgents: Code Analyzer \342\206\222 Debugger \342\206\222 Reviewer/Tester\nOutput: Fixed code with explanations\nFeatures: Edge case analysis + Verification\n\360\237\223\261 Project 4: Instagram Reel Script Crew\nAgents: Content Ideation \342\206\222 Script Writer \342\206\222 Engagement Optimizer\nOutput: Viral reel scripts with captions, hashtags, posting strategies\nFeatures: Scene-by-scene timing + CTAs\n\360\237\233\240\357\270\217 Tech Stack\nPython, CrewAI, Google Gemini/Ollama, Pygame, CrewAI Tools, Python Dotenv\n\n6. \360\237\222\260 Daily-Work-Logger - Google Sheets Integration\nRepository: https://github.com/Vivek5143/Daily-Work-Logger\n\n\360\237\223\235 Description\nA polished Streamlit application that allows users to log daily work activities directly to Google Sheets. Provides a clean, intuitive interface for activity tracking and productivity management.\n\n\360\237\217\227\357\270\217 Architecture\nFrontend: Streamlit UI\nBackend: Python\nIntegration: Google Sheets API\nStorage: Google Sheets cloud storage\n\342\234\250 Key Features\nReal-time activity logging\nGoogle Sheets integration\nUser-friendly Streamlit interface\nCloud-based data persistence\n\360\237\233\240\357\270\217 Tech Stack\nStreamlit, Python, Google Sheets API\n\n\360\237\223\212 Skills & Technologies Summary\nFrontend\nReact 19, Next.js 14, Streamlit, Vite\nTailwindCSS, ShadcnUI, lucide-react\nTypeScript, JavaScript, HTML/CSS\nBackend\nFastAPI, Flask, Python\nPostgreSQL, SQLAlchemy\nDocker, Docker Compose\nAI/ML & LLMs\nLangChain, CrewAI\nDistilBERT, Transformers, PyTorch\nGoogle Gemini, Ollama, Groq\nFAISS Vector Databases\nSentenceTransformers\nMobile\nAndroid Development (Kotlin)\nNotificationListenerService\nRetrofit2, OkHttp3\nDevOps & Deployment\nDocker & Docker Compose\nRender, Vercel, Railway\nCI/CD concepts\nOther\nOCR (Tesseract), NLP\nRAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation)\nMulti-agent orchestration\nAPI development & REST standards\n\360\237\216\257 Project Complexity & Impact\nProject\tComplexity\tComponents\tKey Innovation\nCampusPal\tMedium\t2 (Frontend + Backend)\tRAG pipeline for campus queries\nEduDiff\tMedium\t2 (Next.js + Flask)\tManim + AI for math animations\nTransactAI\tHigh\t4 (Backend + Frontend + Mobile + AI)\tHybrid DistilBERT + Rules system\nInstaClaim\tMedium\t2 (Streamlit + LangChain)\tOCR + Local LLM integration\nMulti-Agent\tMedium-High\t4 CrewAI apps\tMulti-agent collaboration workflows\nDaily-Work-Logger\tLow\t1 (Streamlit)\tGoogle Sheets integration\n\360\237\232\200 Conclusion\nYour portfolio demonstrates strong full-stack capabilities spanning:\n\n\342\234\205 Modern frontend frameworks (React, Next.js, Streamlit)\n\342\234\205 Robust backend services (FastAPI, Flask)\n\342\234\205 AI/ML integration (LLMs, vector databases, fine-tuned models)\n\342\234\205 Mobile development (Android Kotlin)\n\342\234\205 DevOps & deployment (Docker, cloud platforms)\n\342\234\205 Domain expertise (FinTech, EdTech, Insurance, Gaming)\nAll repositories are production-ready with proper documentation, Docker support, and scalable architectures.\n7. \360\237\216\244 Interview Assistant - AI Voice-Based Interview Simulator\nRepository: https://github.com/Vivek5143/Interview-Assistant\n\n\360\237\223\235 Description\nAn AI-powered voice-based interview assistant that simulates real interview scenarios. It uses speech-to-text, large language models, and text-to-speech to create a fully interactive, multi-turn conversational interview experience.\n\n\360\237\217\227\357\270\217 Architecture\nBackend: Flask (Python)\nLLM: Google Gemini (via LangChain)\nSpeech-to-Text: AssemblyAI\nText-to-Speech: Murf AI\nMemory Management: LangGraph\nDeployment: Docker\n\342\234\250 Key Features\n\360\237\216\244 Voice-based interview interaction\n\360\237\247\240 Dynamic question generation using AI\n\360\237\224\201 Multi-turn conversation with memory\n\360\237\224\212 Text-to-speech responses (Murf AI)\n\360\237\223\235 Speech-to-text conversion (AssemblyAI)\n\360\237\216\257 Adaptive questions based on user answers\nFully interactive 5-question interview session\n\360\237\224\204 Workflow\nUser starts interview with a subject\nAI asks the first question\nUser answers using voice input\nAudio is converted to text\nAI analyzes the answer\nNext question is generated\nProcess repeats for 5 questions\n\360\237\233\240\357\270\217 Tech Stack\nFlask, Python, Google Gemini, LangChain, AssemblyAI, Murf AI, LangGraph, Docker\n\nthese are my projects add also the github repo \n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1UltzuS4Hg_R5iG88l78myh7F_EBaUViL/view?usp=sharing\nthis is my latest resume link"
    items {
      text: "Vivek Dalvi - Projects Portfolio Report\nOverview\nBased on your GitHub repositories, here\'s a detailed report of the 6 major projects you\'ve built, showcasing diverse AI/ML, full-stack, and mobile development expertise.\n\n1. \360\237\216\223 CampusPal - AI Campus Assistant\nRepository: https://github.com/Vivek5143/CampusPal\n\n\360\237\223\235 Description\nAn AI-powered campus assistant specifically designed for APSIT (Ajay Patel Institute of Software Technology). It provides intelligent responses to student queries about admissions, fees, courses, placements, faculty, and campus facilities.\n\n\360\237\217\227\357\270\217 Architecture\nFrontend: React 19 + Vite + Tailwind CSS (Floating chat widget)\nBackend: FastAPI + Python\nAI/RAG: LangChain + ChatGroq + FAISS Vector Database\nEmbeddings: Hugging Face sentence-transformers\nDeployment: Docker, Render (backend), Vercel (frontend)\n\342\234\250 Key Features\nRetrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) with FAISS vectors\nChat history persistence with browser local storage\nLight/Dark mode support\nMarkdown-rendered responses with source attribution\nCurated document filtering for high-signal APSIT information\nFull Docker compose setup\n\360\237\233\240\357\270\217 Tech Stack\nReact 19, Vite, Tailwind CSS, FastAPI, LangChain, Groq LLM, FAISS, Hugging Face Embeddings, Docker\n\n2. \360\237\216\254 EduDiff - AI-Powered Math Animation Generator\nRepository: https://github.com/Vivek5143/EduDiff\n\n\360\237\223\235 Description\nA full-stack application that converts text prompts into animated mathematical explanations using Manim, Flask, and Google Gemini. Creates beautiful, publication-quality math visualizations from simple descriptions.\n\n\360\237\217\227\357\270\217 Architecture\nFrontend: Next.js 3000\nBackend: Flask + Manim 5001\nLLM: Google Gemini (via google-genai SDK)\nVideo Generation: Manim (Mathematical Animation Engine)\nDeployment: Docker Compose\n\342\234\250 Key Features\nGenerate Manim videos