      text: "# Vivek Dalvi\n\n## AI Engineer | Agentic AI \342\200\242 RAG \342\200\242 LLM Applications \342\200\242 Full-Stack Development\n\n**Building production-grade Agentic AI systems, Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) pipelines, and intelligent automation solutions that bridge cutting-edge research with real-world applications.**\n\n---\n\n# About Me\n\nI\'m **Vivek Dalvi**, a Computer Engineering graduate and AI Engineer passionate about designing intelligent systems that solve practical problems through Generative AI and Machine Learning.\n\nWith experience as a **Data Science Engineer Intern at Data Science Wizards (DSW)**, I have worked on secure AI solutions, PII detection pipelines, and scalable backend systems. My expertise spans Agentic AI, Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG), LLM applications, NLP, and full-stack development.\n\nI enjoy building AI products that are not only innovative but also reliable, secure, and production-ready. Whether it\'s creating hallucination-resistant chatbots, automated content generation platforms, or intelligent financial assistants, I focus on delivering solutions with real-world impact.\n\n---\n\n# What I Do\n\n### \360\237\244\226 Agentic AI\n\nDesigning autonomous AI systems capable of planning, reasoning, tool usage, and multi-step execution.\n\n### \360\237\223\232 Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG)\n\nBuilding knowledge-grounded applications using vector databases, semantic search, and context-aware retrieval to minimize hallucinations.\n\n### \360\237\247\240 Generative AI & LLM Applications\n\nDeveloping AI-powered products with Gemini, Groq, Ollama, Hugging Face Transformers, and LangChain.\n\n### \360\237\224\220 AI Security & Privacy\n\nImplementing PII detection, encryption, offline inference, and privacy-first AI architectures.\n\n### \360\237\222\273 Full-Stack Development\n\nCreating scalable web applications using React, Next.js, FastAPI, Flask, PostgreSQL, Docker, and modern cloud technologies.\n\n---\n\n# Technical Skills\n\n## Programming Languages\n\n* Python\n* Java\n* C++\n* JavaScript\n* TypeScript\n* SQL\n\n## AI & Machine Learning\n\n* LangChain\n* LangGraph\n* CrewAI\n* Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG)\n* FAISS\n* Hugging Face\n* Transformers\n* DistilBERT\n* Sentence Transformers\n* PyTorch\n* Ollama\n* Google Gemini API\n* Groq LLM\n* Tesseract OCR\n\n## Web & Backend\n\n* React.js\n* Next.js\n* FastAPI\n* Flask\n* Streamlit\n* Node.js\n* SQLAlchemy\n\n## Databases\n\n* PostgreSQL\n* MongoDB\n* ClickHouse\n\n## Mobile & DevOps\n\n* Android Development (Kotlin)\n* NotificationListenerService\n* Retrofit2\n* Docker\n* Docker Compose\n* Kubernetes\n* Git & GitHub\n* Railway\n* Render\n* Vercel\n\n---\n\n# Selected Projects\n\n## CampusPal\n\n**AI-Powered Campus Assistant**\n\nCampusPal is an intelligent assistant designed specifically for educational institutions, enabling students to access accurate information about admissions, placements, courses, faculty, fees, and campus facilities.\n\n### Highlights\n\n* Built using Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) with FAISS vector search\n* Implements a 5-layer hallucination prevention strategy\n* Hybrid ReAct Agent capable of switching between local knowledge retrieval and live web search\n* Persistent chat history with browser storage\n* Markdown-rendered responses with source attribution\n\n**Tech Stack:** React 19 \342\200\242 FastAPI \342\200\242 LangChain \342\200\242 FAISS \342\200\242 Groq LLM \342\200\242 Hugging Face \342\200\242 Docker\n\n---\n\n## EduDiff\n\n**AI-Powered Prompt-to-Video Learning Platform**\n\nEduDiff transforms natural language prompts into mathematical animations and educational videos using Google Gemini and Manim.\n\n### Highlights\n\n* Converts complex concepts into animated educational content\n* Automated prompt-to-Manim code generation\n* Containerized rendering pipeline using Docker\n* Multiple quality modes with REST API integration\n\n**Tech Stack:** Next.js \342\200\242 Flask \342\200\242 Manim \342\200\242 Google Gemini \342\200\242 Docker \342\200\242 Python\n\n---\n\n## TransactAI\n\n**Hybrid Financial Transaction Intelligence Platform**\n\nA production-grade transaction categorization engine combining deterministic banking rules with machine learning and semantic embeddings.\n\n### Highlights\n\n* Three-layer classification architecture\n\n  * Rule-based routing\n  * DistilBERT prediction\n  * Embedding similarity fallback\n* Android application parses UPI and SMS notifications\n* Interactive analytics dashboard for spending insights\n\n**Tech Stack:** FastAPI \342\200\242 PostgreSQL \342\200\242 PyTorch \342\200\242 DistilBERT \342\200\242 Next.js \342\200\242 Kotlin \342\200\242 Docker\n\n---\n\n## InstaClaim\n\n**Offline AI Insurance Claim Assistant**\n\nA privacy-first insurance chatbot capable of processing documents locally without cloud dependency.\n\n### Highlights\n\n* OCR-powered document extraction using Tesseract\n* Fully offline inference using Ollama models\n* Secure metadata injection into LangChain workflows\n* Zero external data leakage\n\n**Tech Stack:** Streamlit \342\200\242 LangChain \342\200\242 Ollama \342\200\242 Tesseract OCR \342\200\242 Python\n\n---\n\n## Multi-Agent Platform\n\n**Collaborative AI Workflow System**\n\nA platform where specialized AI agents cooperate to accomplish complex tasks through structured workflows.\n\n### Features\n\n* Sequential CrewAI orchestration\n* Automated game generation pipelines\n* AI code review and debugging\n* Social media content planning\n* Multi-agent collaboration architecture\n\n**Tech Stack:** CrewAI \342\200\242 Python \342\200\242 Gemini \342\200\242 Ollama \342\200\242 Pygame\n\n---\n\n## Daily Work Logger\n\n**Natural Language Productivity Tracker**\n\nTransforms unstructured daily notes into structured logs with automatic cloud synchronization.\n\n### Highlights\n\n* Natural language parsing engine\n* Google Sheets integration\n* Automated categorization\n* Reduces manual logging effort\n\n**Tech Stack:** Python \342\200\242 Streamlit \342\200\242 Google Sheets API \342\200\242 Gemini API\n\n---\n\n## Interview Assistant\n\n**Voice-Based AI Interview Simulator**\n\nAn interactive AI interviewer that conducts technical interviews using speech recognition and contextual memory.\n\n### Highlights\n\n* Multi-turn interview conversations\n* Dynamic follow-up questioning\n* Speech-to-text and text-to-speech integration\n* LangGraph state management\n\n**Tech Stack:** Flask \342\200\242 LangChain \342\200\242 LangGraph \342\200\242 AssemblyAI \342\200\242 Murf AI \342\200\242 Gemini\n\n---\n\n# Professional Experience\n\n## Data Science Engineer Intern\n\n### Data Science Wizards (DSW)\n\n**August 2025 \342\200\223 February 2026**\n\n* Built secure PII detection and encryption pipelines using Microsoft Presidio\n* Contributed to production-grade observability platforms for enterprise environments\n* Improved backend architecture and API design for scalable AI services\n* Collaborated with cross-functional teams to develop privacy-focused intelligent systems\n* Focused on compliance, automation, and secure data processing\n\n---\n\n# Education\n\n## Bachelor of Engineering (Computer Engineering)\n\n**A.P. Shah Institute of Technology**\n\n* Specialization: Artificial Intelligence & Machine Learning\n* CGPA: **8.4**\n* Honors: **Cyber Security**\n\n---\n\n# Core Areas of Interest\n\n* Agentic AI\n* Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG)\n* Large Language Models (LLMs)\n* Generative AI\n* Machine Learning\n* Natural Language Processing\n* AI Automation\n* AI Security & Privacy\n* Full-Stack Development\n\n---\n\n# My Philosophy\n\nI believe AI should do more than generate text\342\200\224it should reason, retrieve accurate information, automate meaningful workflows, and solve real-world challenges responsibly. My goal is to build intelligent systems that are scalable, trustworthy, and impactful.\n\n---\n\n# Let\'s Connect\n\nI\'m always excited to collaborate on AI, Machine Learning, and software engineering projects or discuss opportunities in research and industry.\n\n**Building AI that doesn\'t just generate answers\342\200\224but understands, reasons, and acts.**\n\nput the uploaded images as a thumbnails for the projects\n\n# Build a Premium AI Engineer Portfolio Website\n\nCreate a **world-class, Apple-inspired, award-winning personal portfolio website** for **Vivek Dalvi**, an **AI Engineer specializing in Agentic AI, Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG), Large Language Models, and Intelligent Automation**.\n\nThe website should feel like a blend of **Linear.app, Vercel, Stripe, Framer, and Apple**, with smooth animations, modern typography, glassmorphism effects, subtle gradients, and exceptional attention to detail.\n\n---\n\n# Overall Theme\n\n* Dark premium theme (#050816 background)\n* Accent colors: Purple (#7C3AED), Blue (#3B82F6), Emerald (#10B981)\n* Glassmorphism cards\n* Rounded corners (20-24px)\n* Soft shadows and glowing borders\n* Animated gradient blobs in background\n* Smooth page transitions\n* Scroll-triggered animations\n* Floating particles\n* Modern sans-serif typography (Inter + Sora)\n* Fully responsive\n* SEO optimized\n\nThe portfolio should feel like it belongs to an engineer working at OpenAI, Anthropic, Google DeepMind, or NVIDIA.\n\n---\n\n# Hero Section\n\nLarge split-screen hero.\n\nLeft Side:\n\n# Vivek Dalvi\n\n## AI Engineer\n\n### Building Agentic AI, RAG & LLM-Powered Applications\n\nText:\n\nBuilding production-grade intelligent systems that combine Generative AI, Retrieval-Augmented Generation, autonomous agents, and modern software engineering to solve real-world problems.\n\nButtons:\n\n* View Projects\n* Download Resume\n* Contact Me\n\nDisplay social icons:\n\n* GitHub\n* LinkedIn\n* Email\n* Resume\n\nRight Side:\n\nLarge animated illustration showing:\n\n* AI nodes\n* Neural network\n* Floating code\n* Agent workflow\n* LLM pipeline\n* Vector embeddings\n* Chat bubbles\n* Database icons\n\nInclude animated glowing effects.\n\n---\n\n# About Section\n\nTitle:\n\n## About Me\n\nContent:\n\nI\'m Vivek Dalvi, a Computer Engineering graduate and AI Engineer passionate about building production-grade AI applications.\n\nI specialize in Agentic AI, Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG), Large Language Models, NLP, and Full-Stack Development.\n\nAs a former Data Science Engineer Intern at Data Science Wizards (DSW), I worked on secure PII detection pipelines, intelligent automation systems, and scalable backend architectures.\n\nMy mission is to build AI that doesn\'t just generate text\342\200\224but reasons, retrieves, plans, and acts.\n\nDisplay with timeline animation.\n\n---\n\n# Tech Stack\n\nCreate an interactive Bento Grid.\n\n## Languages\n\n* Python\n* Java\n* C++\n* JavaScript\n* TypeScript\n* SQL\n\n## AI\n\n* LangChain\n* LangGraph\n* CrewAI\n* FAISS\n* Hugging Face\n* Transformers\n* DistilBERT\n* PyTorch\n* Ollama\n* Google Gemini\n* Groq\n* Tesseract OCR\n\n## Frontend\n\n* React\n* Next.js\n* Tailwind\n* Vite\n\n## Backend\n\n* FastAPI\n* Flask\n* Node.js\n\n## Database\n\n* PostgreSQL\n* MongoDB\n* ClickHouse\n\n## DevOps\n\n* Docker\n* Kubernetes\n* Railway\n* Render\n* Vercel\n\nEach skill should animate on hover.\n\n---\n\n# Featured Projects\n\nCreate premium project cards.\n\nAlternate layout left/right.\n\nEvery project should include:\n\n* Hero thumbnail\n* Overview\n* Key Features\n* Architecture\n* Technologies\n* GitHub button\n* Live Demo button\n* Animated preview\n\n---\n\n## 1. CampusPal\n\nUse the uploaded CampusPal thumbnail.\n\nTitle:\n\nCampusPal\n\nSubtitle:\n\nAI-Powered Campus Assistant\n\nDescription:\n\nAn intelligent RAG-powered campus assistant providing accurate responses about admissions, placements, fees, faculty, and facilities through hybrid retrieval and live web search.\n\nHighlights:\n\n* FAISS-based semantic retrieval\n* Hybrid ReAct Agent\n* 5-layer hallucination prevention\n* Live web fallback\n* Persistent chat history\n* Source attribution\n\nTech:\n\nReact \342\200\242 FastAPI \342\200\242 LangChain \342\200\242 FAISS \342\200\242 Groq \342\200\242 Docker\n\n---\n\n## 2. EduDiff\n\nUse the uploaded EduDiff thumbnail.\n\nSubtitle:\n\nPrompt-to-Video Learning Platform\n\nDescription:\n\nTransforms natural language into animated math lessons using Google Gemini and Manim.\n\nShow pipeline:\n\nPrompt\n\n\342\206\223\n\nGemini\n\n\342\206\223\n\nGenerated Manim Code\n\n\342\206\223\n\nDocker Render\n\n\342\206\223\n\nMP4 Video\n\nHighlights:\n\n* AI code generation\n* Automated rendering\n* Multiple quality modes\n* REST API\n\n---\n\n## 3. TransactAI\n\nUse uploaded thumbnail.\n\nSubtitle:\n\nAI Transaction Intelligence\n\nDescription:\n\nHybrid financial categorization engine combining deterministic rules, DistilBERT, and semantic embeddings.\n\nArchitecture:\n\nRules\n\n\342\206\223\n\nDistilBERT\n\n\342\206\223\n\nEmbeddings\n\n\342\206\223\n\nPrediction\n\nHighlights:\n\n* SMS parsing\n* Android integration\n* Analytics dashboard\n* Spending insights\n\n---\n\n## 4. InstaClaim\n\nUse uploaded thumbnail.\n\nSubtitle:\n\nOffline Insurance AI Assistant\n\nDescription:\n\nPrivacy-first insurance chatbot processing OCR documents with local LLMs.\n\nHighlights:\n\n* Offline Ollama\n* OCR extraction\n* Zero cloud dependency\n* Secure document analysis\n\n---\n\n## 5. Multi-Agent Platform\n\nUse uploaded thumbnail.\n\nSubtitle:\n\nCollaborative AI Agent System\n\nDescription:\n\nCrewAI-powered platform where specialized agents collaborate to complete complex workflows.\n\nInclude animated workflow diagram.\n\nHighlights:\n\n* Planner Agent\n* Research Agent\n* Coding Agent\n* Reviewer Agent\n* Memory sharing\n\n---\n\n## 6. Daily Work Logger\n\nUse uploaded thumbnail.\n\nSubtitle:\n\nNatural Language Productivity Tracker\n\nDescription:\n\nTransforms free-text work logs into structured records with Google Sheets synchronization.\n\nHighlights:\n\n* NLP parsing\n* Auto categorization\n* Google Sheets sync\n* Productivity analytics\n\n---\n\n## 7. Interview Assistant\n\nUse uploaded thumbnail.\n\nSubtitle:\n\nVoice-Based AI Interview Simulator\n\nDescription:\n\nInteractive interview coach using speech recognition and contextual memory.\n\nHighlights:\n\n* Speech-to-text\n* Text-to-speech\n* LangGraph memory\n* Adaptive questioning\n* AI feedback\n\n---\n\n# Experience\n\nTimeline Design\n\n## Data Science Wizards (DSW)\n\nData Science Engineer Intern\n\nAug 2025 \342\200\223 Feb 2026\n\nAchievements:\n\n* Built secure PII detection pipeline using Microsoft Presidio\n* Developed encryption workflows\n* Improved backend architecture\n* Worked on production observability systems\n* Collaborated across engineering teams\n\n---\n\n# Education\n\nCard Layout\n\nBachelor of Engineering\n\nComputer Engineering\n\nA.P. Shah Institute of Technology\n\nCGPA: 8.4\n\nHonors:\n\nCyber Security\n\n---\n\n# Core Expertise\n\nDisplay animated cards:\n\n* Agentic AI\n* RAG Systems\n* LLM Applications\n* Machine Learning\n* NLP\n* AI Automation\n* AI Security\n* Full Stack Development\n\n---\n\n# GitHub Stats Section\n\nShow:\n\n* Contributions\n* Repositories\n* Languages\n* Activity Graph\n* Streak\n\nInclude animated counters.\n\n---\n\n# Contact Section\n\nMinimal premium layout.\n\nHeading:\n\nLet\'s Build Something Amazing.\n\nInclude:\n\n* Email\n* LinkedIn\n* GitHub\n* Resume\n\nLarge CTA:\n\nGet In Touch\n\n---\n\n# Footer\n\nCenter aligned.\n\nQuote:\n\n\"Building AI that doesn\'t just generate answers\342\200\224but understands, reasons, retrieves, and acts.\"\n\nInclude copyright:\n\n\302\251 2026 Vivek Dalvi. All Rights Reserved.\n\n---\n\n# Animations\n\n* Framer Motion style page transitions\n* Fade-up on scroll\n* Staggered card reveals\n* Hover scale effects\n* Floating glowing particles\n* Animated gradient backgrounds\n* Typing effect in Hero\n* Smooth parallax scrolling\n* Magnetic buttons\n* Mouse-follow glow\n* Project cards tilt slightly on hover\n\n---\n\n# Performance & Quality\n\n* 95+ Lighthouse score\n* Lazy load images\n* Optimized assets\n* Fully responsive\n* Mobile-first design\n* Accessibility compliant\n* SEO friendly\n* Fast loading\n* Professional recruiter-ready presentation\n\n---\n\n# Final Goal\n\nThe final website should instantly communicate that Vivek Dalvi is a **top-tier AI Engineer** with expertise in **Agentic AI, RAG, LLM applications, Generative AI, Machine Learning, and Full-Stack Development**, making it suitable for recruiters from **OpenAI, Google, Microsoft, NVIDIA, Amazon, Meta, Anthropic, and high-growth AI startups**. The design should feel premium, memorable, and visually stunning while remaining clean, modern, and highly professional."
