          text: "    { sender: \'ai\', text: \"APSIT has an outstanding placement record with 150+ core companies visiting each year. The highest package stands at 32 LPA, and the average package is 6.6 LPA.\", sources: [\"placement_2024.pdf\", \"official_brochure.pdf\"] }"
