    thinking: "**Verifying Project Completion**\n\nI\'m pleased to report that the linting and compilation steps were successful. I\'m now focusing on ensuring that all project files are finalized, cleaned, and that I\'ve completely addressed the user\'s prompt. I\'ve noted the user\'s specific request for hover visuals inspired by the antigravity website, and I successfully implemented a fully performant, responsive custom solution.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have integrated the hover visual effects to match the premium, interactive aesthetic of the **Antigravity** website:\n\n### \342\232\241 **Implementation Highlights & Craft Details**\n\n1. **`SpotlightCard` Component (`/src/components/SpotlightCard.tsx`)**:\n   - **Backdrop Radial Glow**: Implemented state-less hardware-accelerated coordinates tracking. Utilizing Framer Motion\'s `useMotionValue` and custom string interpolation `useMotionTemplate`, a vector glow tracks the cursor inside the card smoothly without triggering high-frequency React virtual DOM re-renders.\n   - **Border Tracing Highlight**: Styled an overlay using dynamic SVG/CSS masks (`maskComposite: \'exclude\'`). The card border itself lights up tracing exactly under the cursor\'s path.\n   - **3D Parallax Tilt**: Calculated relative coordinates along the X and Y axes to apply subtle rotations (`rotateX`, `rotateY`), creating a realistic, responsive 3D dimensional tilt that tilts the card toward the pointer position.\n   - **Dampened Reset**: Stood up responsive resets that return the card alignment gracefully to the center coordinates upon mouse hover leave events.\n\n2. **Refactored Dashboard Sections (`/src/App.tsx`)**:\n   - **Hero Agent Pipeline Blueprint**: Upgraded the interactive orchestrator blueprint with the full interactive spotlight.\n   - **Bio Philosophy Cards**: Applied spotlight cards with tailored custom green (`rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1)`) and purple (`rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.1)`) glow modes matching the theme of each respective principle.\n   - **Achievements & Educational Track**: Re-styled the timeline block to benefit from full 3D card tilt and responsive highlight gradients.\n   - **Technical Bento Grid**: Wrapped all 3 major categories in customized spotlights with color-coded gradients matching the specific stack.\n   - **Selected Works sub-widgets**: Re-mapped all 7 interactive simulation screens to utilize customized spotlight templates (e.g. emerald glow for academic query assistant *CampusPal*, violet for mathematical renderer *EduDiff*, blue for financial processor *TransactAI*, and gold for OCR reader *InstaClaim*).\n   - **Developer Analytics & Contact CTAs**: Upgraded key metrics dashboards with corresponding emerald highlights."
    thinking_duration {
      nanos: 199216102
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
